Wonders of Water - NullCascade (Nexus Mods, Morrowind mod 52815, version 1.0, 2023)
https://www.nexusmods.com/morrowind/mods/52815
https://github.com/NullCascade/morrowind-mods

The mod page's licence statement, verbatim: "MIT licensed. Do what you want with it.
Don't blame me for what you do with it." The archive carries no licence file of its
own, so the MIT licence text is reproduced here for the rules Wraithguard adapts from
it (viewer-shell/ui/src/25_sky.js per-weather wave and caustics multipliers, 26_water.js
still water in interiors, 06_gl.js underwater fog by depth).

